        "content": "## Carrier nodes (add manually)\n\nThis template does **not** send real traffic.\n\nWhen `MEDFLOW_TEST_MODE=false`, wire carrier nodes using n8n credential IDs:\n\n**This workflow:** \n\nPlaceholders: TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID, EMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID, VAPI_CREDENTIAL_ID, OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID, GOOGLE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
